# BloodFlow API — quick manual tests from Visual Studio.
# 1) Run the API (https profile).
# 2) Send the login request, copy "token" from the response into @token below.
# ⚠️ Never commit real passwords: keep YOUR_PASSWORD here and type the real one only while testing.

@host = https://localhost:7244
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Login (System Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bloodflow.local",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### Lookups (public)
GET {{host}}/api/lookups/governorates

###
GET {{host}}/api/lookups/organizations?type=Hospital

### Admin: create a hospital
POST {{host}}/api/admin/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Hospital",
  "name": "مستشفى القصر العيني",
  "cityName": "القاهرة",
  "governorateId": 1
}

### Staff self-registration (public) → account is Pending
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sara Ahmed",
  "email": "sara@example.com",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD",
  "organizationId": 1,
  "jobTitle": "Blood bank nurse"
}

### Admin: approval queue
GET {{host}}/api/admin/staff?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: approve staff user 2
POST {{host}}/api/admin/staff/2/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: reject staff user 2
POST {{host}}/api/admin/staff/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Could not confirm employment with the hospital."
}

### Admin: settings
GET {{host}}/api/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: audit trail
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-logs?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Slice 2: inventory (log in as an approved staff member first) ----------

### Stock summary
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manual intake: 10 units of O+ (bloodGroupId 7); expiry defaults to collection + 35 days
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bloodGroupId": 7,
  "quantity": 10,
  "collectionDate": "2026-11-19",
  "clientRequestId": "6f1c2a52-6b0e-4c55-9a43-1f4b3c2d8e01"
}

### Batches expiring within 7 days (FEFO order)
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/batches?expiringWithinDays=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove 2 damaged units from batch 1
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/batches/1/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityDelta": -2,
  "reasonCode": "Damaged",
  "reason": "Two bags leaked in the fridge.",
  "clientRequestId": "9a0d7c11-2f3e-4b8a-8c6d-5e4f3a2b1c00"
}

### Stock ledger
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
